\ FDISASS.SEQ   Floating point disassembler extensions  by Robert L. Smith
\       Prefix version  Modified  10/21/92  R.L.S.
\                                                       F-PC native port

comment:

  Native port: this file added the 8087 (ESC) opcodes to the 8086
disassembler in DIS8086.SEQ. There is no 8086 or 8087 code on the VM:
floating point is a set of VM built-ins (F+ F* FSQRT ... ), and CODE words
are abstract-machine code, which DISASSEM.SEQ disassembles completely. So
this file only loads DIS8086.SEQ, for files that NEEDS it.

comment;

NEEDS DIS8086.SEQ
